# Car health values for nbt_health (src/health/nbt_health.c). One value per line, '|' separated:
# label|src|module|id|offset|length|signed|factor|add|unit|decimals|ok_lo|ok_hi|watch_lo|watch_hi|when
# src obd = OBD-II service 01 PID, did = UDS 22 DID; module/id in hex; offset/length = bytes after the echoed id,
# big-endian; value = raw*factor+add; empty limit = none; when: run / off / any (limits apply only then).
# Decodes checked against this car's capture (2026-11-22, warm idle and engine off); sources: emdzej SGBD docs
# d73n57e0 / d70bx7a0 (DME), komb01 (KOMBI). Limits are for this F10 530d (N57 diesel); tune after real drives.
#
# engine
Coolant|obd|12|05|0|1|0|1|-40|C|0|75|105|50|112|run
Engine speed|obd|12|0C|0|2|0|0.25|0|rpm|0|||||any
Engine load|obd|12|04|0|1|0|0.392157|0|%|0|||||any
Intake air|obd|12|0F|0|1|0|1|-40|C|0||60||75|run
Boost (MAP)|obd|12|0B|0|1|0|1|0|kPa|0|||||any
Radiator fan|did|12|60DA|0|2|0|0.01|0|%|0||50||90|run
# battery (IBS on the battery, via the DME)
Battery|did|12|402B|2|2|0|0.00025|6|V|2|13.6|15.0|13.0|15.5|run
Battery|did|12|402B|2|2|0|0.00025|6|V|2|12.2||11.9||off
Battery charge|did|12|4023|17|1|0|1|0|%|0|60||45||any
Battery current|did|12|402B|4|2|0|0.08|-200|A|1||25||40|off
Battery temp|did|12|402B|0|2|1|0.1|0|C|0||45||55|any
# fuel and trip (cluster)
Fuel|did|60|D11F|6|2|0|0.0078125|0|l|0|15||8||any
Range|did|60|D126|6|2|0|0.1|0|km|0|||||any
Avg consumption|did|60|D126|0|2|0|0.01|0|l/100|1|||||any
Outside temp|did|60|D112|0|1|0|0.5|-40|C|0|||||any
# diesel particulate filter
DPF soot|did|12|5FB4|42|2|0|0.01|0|g|1||20||35|any
DPF regens|did|12|5FB4|46|2|0|1|0||0|||||any
